{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-al-tay-hills","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"al-tay-hills-sharjah-ifa-hotels-and-resorts","about":"Al Tay Hills is a masterfully planned, serene community in Sharjah, designed to elevate the standard of living. It offers a diverse selection of elegantly designed homes, including 3-bedroom townhouses, 4-bedroom townhouses and twin villas, 4-bedroom standalone villas, 5-bedroom standalone villas, and 6-bedroom mansions. Featuring a unique Green River—the largest in the region—nestled within a lush landscape, Al Tay Hills at Sharjah, UAE, provides an array of sports complexes, kids' play areas, running and cycling tracks, an amphitheater, community centers, cafés, and a dedicated mosque.Every home in Al Tay Hills is thoughtfully crafted with spacious layouts, high-end finishes, and a strong emphasis on privacy. Developed by Kuwait Real Estate Company (AQARAT) in partnership with IFA Hotels and Resorts, the meticulously designed homes feature fully fitted kitchens and contemporary aesthetics. Residents can enjoy an unparalleled lifestyle with access to green spaces, parks, and recreational zones, fostering a vibrant community atmosphere.","price":3700000,"title":"Al Tay Hills","bitrix":{"id":1143,"pf_id":"are.3.14832","source":null,"project_id":"Al Tay West","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Al Tay Hills","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"IFA Hotels and Resorts","project_location":"Al Suyoh"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Al_Tay_Hills_in_Sharjah_UAE_ec2c72dc60.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Al_Tay_Hills_in_Sharjah_UAE_ec2c72dc60.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.3282013,"lng":55.4298953},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Al_Tay_Hills_in_Sharjah_UAE_792ecc322f.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgp